      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a start, but i want to dig deeper into the 'Low-Tier' stuff. the rat-like thing is a bit cliché. i want them to feel like a different kind of human, almost like they've been shaped by their environment over generations. \n\ncan you go more into detail about their physical appearance? like, what are some of the specific skin tones, hair textures, or facial features that would help readers immediately identify them as part of the lower class? i want to avoid just saying they look 'poor' and instead use more descriptive, biological-sounding traits that separate them from the 'perfected' look of the High-Tiers.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
